  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "This is Carol.\r\nShe loves to cook the tastiest of drinks and pastries
    to bring out smiles on all around her. She is studying to become a mechanical
    engineer.\r\nCarol owns a caf\xE9 in a mall near her city's heart, \r\nselling
    coffee, vitamins, pastries and cupcakes, cookies, and most importantly, boba
    tea!\r\nAnything you can dream of.\r\nBut, in the end, all that is good is better
    eaten piping hot.\r\nDuring an ordinary Monday, Carol received and served customers
    like always, until a loud noise could be heard from the mall's main lounge.\r\nLooking
    outside her shop, reality seemed to fade out.\r\nAll was in flames, folks running
    chaotically left to right trying to get somewhere safe.\r\nA colossal crater,
    and in its middle, a meteor was visible.\r\nAnd from the meteor, a terrifying
    creature appeared..."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
